{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the table/column rename project.",
    "Every artefact - SQL migration, codemod, leftover guard, post-migration",
    "verification - is generated from THIS file. Never hand-edit a generated",
    "migration and never rename something in code that is not listed here.",
    "",
    "status:  'example' -> ignored by every command",
    "         'planned' -> processed",
    "         'done'    -> ignored, kept as documentation",
    "",
    "columns[].scope:",
    "  'global' -> the column name is unique enough to replace repo-wide.",
    "              Only allowed if `check` confirms no other table carries a",
    "              column of the same name (or you are renaming it on all of",
    "              them). This is the only scope the codemod applies.",
    "  'table'  -> the same column name exists on other tables that are NOT",
    "              being renamed. Cannot be automated - a repo-wide replace",
    "              would corrupt the other tables' call sites. `apply` skips",
    "              these and lists every occurrence for manual review.",
    "",
    "columns[].api - the snake_case twin in request bodies (name_long -> name):",
    "  false          -> no request field carries this name",
    "  true           -> derive both sides by lowercasing",
    "  { from, to }   -> spell it out. Required when either side is an everyday",
    "                    word, because as a source it would match unrelated code",
    "                    and as a target it can collide with a local variable.",
    "",
    "dynamicWatch  - extra identifier prefixes to flag wherever the code",
    "                interpolates into a string, e.g. `SURCHARGE_${i}_LABEL`.",
    "alwaysReview  - files that build a column name entirely from a variable.",
    "                No search can find those; they get read every single block."
  ],
  "dynamicWatch": [
    "SURCHARGE_",
    "ZONE_",
    "XML_ZUGFERD_"
  ],
  "alwaysReview": [
    "backend/services/emailTemplates.js   - .select(`ID, ${numberCol}, ${dateCol}, …`)",
    "backend/services/stammdaten.js       - FEE_ZONE_COLUMN_BY_ROMAN builds ZONE_* names",
    "backend/services/nachtraege.js       - `SURCHARGE_${i}_LABEL/_PCT/_CUMUL` over [1,2,3]",
    "backend/services/dependencyCheck.js  - safeReferences(table, selectFields, filter)",
    "backend/services/importService.js    - DOMAINS registry: table / dependents[].column",
    "backend/demo/exportTenant.js         - TENANT_TABLES / COMPANY_TABLES / PARENT_TABLES",
    "backend/demo/seed/lib/reset.js       - MOVEMENT_TABLES"
  ],
